        'en' => ['How do you prepare a teaching unit?', 'Objectives, prerequisites, progression, activities, assessment.',
            ['Learning objectives|objectives,skills,curriculum,outcomes', 'Prerequisites and progression|prerequisite,progression,steps,lessons', 'Varied activities|activities,group work,exercises,role play,project', 'Assessment|assessment,criteria,formative,summative,rubric'],
            ['Starting from activities without objectives', 'Assessing skills that were not taught'],
            'I start from curriculum skills and write precise learning objectives. I check prerequisites, then build a progression across lessons, from discovery to practice and application. I vary activities and plan formative checks during the unit and a final assessment with a rubric shared with pupils.',
            'objectives,progression,activities,assessment'],
